    "custom_liquid_VkW6EH": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"kk-homepage-content\">\n<h2>Premium Office Furniture in NZ: Shop Online for Your Ideal Workspace</h2>\n\n<p>Since 1996, SmartOffice Furniture has operated as New Zealand&rsquo;s leading provider of premium office furniture at affordable prices. You&rsquo;ve reached the perfect destination for online office furniture purchases! Our New Zealand-owned and operated business is dedicated to helping you build a productive, comfortable, and stylish workspace. Our wide range of office furniture solutions fulfils business requirements and personal preferences across New Zealand, making us the top online office furniture supplier in the country. <a id=\"show-more\" href=\"#read-more\">Read More</a></p>\n\n<div id=\"read-more\">\n<h2>The Ultimate Convenience: Find Your Office Furniture Online</h2>\n\n<p>Today&rsquo;s world demands convenient services above all else. Our website offers a seamless shopping experience for <strong>office furniture in New Zealand</strong> through its simple online shopping platform. Our entire product range is accessible through our website, which you can access from anywhere with internet access, at any time of day or night.</p>\n\n<p>Our delivery system operates across the nation with distribution centres in main locations to provide quick services throughout the country for <strong>office furniture in Auckland, Christchurch, and Wellington</strong>.</p>\n\n<h2>Solutions for Every Environment from Home Offices to Corporate Headquarters</h2>\n\n<p>Our business provides furniture solutions that match the evolving nature of contemporary work environments. Our <strong>home office furniture</strong> collection serves as the ideal solution to develop effective remote work areas. The extensive home office furniture range includes both compact workstations and ergonomic seating options alongside innovative storage systems that fit perfectly into any interior design.</p>\n\n<p>On the other hand, our commercial furniture selection caters to corporate customers by providing items that are both durable and effective.</p>\n\n<p>Our products include a range of premium <strong>executive office furniture for sale</strong>, which features luxurious leather chairs, alongside refined boardroom tables that create enduring business impressions. Our Cubit and Pulse office suites provide integrated, compatible furniture systems that create professional and cohesive spaces. Our company provides all necessary office equipment, including reception furniture, along with filing systems and team collaboration workstations to complete your office setup.</p>\n\n<p>We maintain your health as our top priority regardless of the environment. Our product line includes <a href=\"/collections/ergonomic-office-chairs\">ergonomic chairs</a> that minimise strain and <a href=\"/collections/electric-standing-desks\">height-adjustable standing desks</a> that help users develop better work practices. Our selection includes <a href=\"/collections/office-furniture-tables-flip-folding-tables\">versatile flip and folding tables</a> for dynamic spaces, along with <a href=\"/collections/lockable-office-drawers\">secure lockable drawers for storage</a> to meet functional and comfort needs.</p>\n\n<h2>Why SmartOffice Furniture NZ?</h2>\n\n<p>Our dedication reaches further than just our product offerings. We strive to deliver superior value combined with excellent service to our customers. Our direct business with leading manufacturers and importers allows us to maintain affordable prices that do not affect product quality. Our company backs its products through a &lsquo;Try Before You Buy&rsquo; program for select items. We also provide Afterpay payment security and free delivery to metropolitan areas, along with dedicated sourcing support for your business needs.</p>\n\n<p>Take your office space or home workspace to the next level today. Explore our broad selection of <strong>office furniture online</strong> to discover why we have maintained our position as the trusted business and homeowner partner across New Zealand for nearly thirty years.</p>\n\n<p>SmartOffice Furniture enables you to <a href=\"/pages/office-fit-outs\">transform your office</a> into a productive and stylish centre through our products. <a href=\"#read-more\" id=\"hide-less\">Read Less</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "padding_top": 28,
        "padding_bottom": 28
      }
    },
